  "description": "I was reborn as a web novel character and found out that I was destined to be assassinated by my rivals! \n\nMy name is Moyong Ah-rin, a girl who just lost her parents and joined the Moyong sect, one of the strongest groups in Murim. To avoid the inevitable, I disguised myself as a boy and changed my name to Moyong Ah-hyun. But there's one problem, my brother-in-arms and distant relative, Moyong Chun, is taking an interest in me... \n\nStop obsessing over me, Brother Chun! If you love me, my fate won't change!\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS) \n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
